{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Demo Disclaimer:</i> <i>This demo is a limited version and ends on day 8. It represents only a small portion of the full content available in Orium.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505100/extras/78f7a14c2d6c065deba14ab05e35c5c1.poster.avif?t=1753842455\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505100/extras/78f7a14c2d6c065deba14ab05e35c5c1.webm?t=1753842455\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505100/extras/78f7a14c2d6c065deba14ab05e35c5c1.mp4?t=1753842455\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The universe is dying out, galaxy by galaxy, but capitalism waits for no one. Aboard your spaceship, S-Corp expects you to increase its revenue by greedily exploiting every star system in your path. After all, just because the stars are fading away doesn\u2019t mean business has to stop!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505100/extras/6f94dff4a7f662294ec898c58e4f0038.avif?t=1753842455\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Explore a procedurally generated galaxy</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each expedition takes place in a new galaxy, reactivate abandoned S-Corp beacons or travel through wormholes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Exploit everything in your path</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You only have few days to complete your mission, so make the most of this precious time for our shareholders with your automated production factories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505100/extras/1f5ccc3f24fc108228ce59d2830ea82e.poster.avif?t=1753842455\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505100/extras/1f5ccc3f24fc108228ce59d2830ea82e.webm?t=1753842455\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505100/extras/1f5ccc3f24fc108228ce59d2830ea82e.mp4?t=1753842455\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Exterminate the scourge devouring the universe before it takes over you</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">An elusive being is gradually taking over the galaxy, and you've got to carve your path by blasting its minions back to where they came from with your laser.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Optimize your ship</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every battle makes you stronger, and your discoveries across the galaxy can influence your victory. And if you're running late, your best colleague Bogg is always here to help.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505100/extras/c8316d340675be881cb6de63fac7d764.avif?t=1753842455\" data-has-big /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A random galaxy to exploit despite its decline</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Tens of thousands of stars just waiting to be exploited</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Different types of cosmic monsters to stop you in your tracks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Upgrades as you progress through battles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Narrative events to enhance your victory strategy</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3505100?t=1753842455","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505100/3908412099efa99e6c99c1a3da255cc4748b81b5/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1753842455","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505100/247e4bad0ed05ee70307bce4ba4766ba2d206e8e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753842455","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505100/247e4bad0ed05ee70307bce4ba4766ba2d206e8e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753842455","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Demo Disclaimer:</i> <i>This demo is a limited version and ends on day 8. It represents only a small portion of the full content available in Orium.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505100/extras/78f7a14c2d6c065deba14ab05e35c5c1.poster.avif?t=1753842455\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505100/extras/78f7a14c2d6c065deba14ab05e35c5c1.webm?t=1753842455\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3505100/extras/78f7a14c2d6c065deba14ab05e35c5c1.mp4?t=1753842455\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The universe is dying out, galaxy by galaxy, but capitalism waits for no one. Aboard your spaceship, S-Corp expects you to increase its revenue by greedily exploiting every star system in your path. After all, just because the sta